# OG and Social Previews

## Standard

Follow `docs/seo/OG-IMAGE-STANDARD.md` and skill `.cursor/skills/og-social-preview/SKILL.md`.

## Required on every indexable page

- Absolute `og:image` (prefer `/images/og/*-1200x630.jpg`)
- Companion square when available (`*-1200x1200.jpg`) as second OG image
- Width, height, and alt on Open Graph images
- `twitter:card` = `summary_large_image` with the landscape URL

## Do not

- Point social tags at WordPress CDN URLs or multi-megabyte raw heroes
- Use the migrated WP site banner (`ecomglidersbanner-…`) for home/blog index
- Omit `metadataBase` / absolute URLs
- Redesign every blog featured image when only the OG derivative needs a crop

## When changing heroes or adding pages

1. Update source art under `public/images/`
2. Run `npm run generate:og`
3. Set `seo.ogImage` to the new landscape path
4. Verify head tags on staging; refresh platform debuggers after production cutover

## Code entry points

- `src/lib/seo/og-images.ts` — sizes, defaults, resolver
- `src/lib/seo/page-metadata.ts` — Metadata emission
- `scripts/generate-og-images.mjs` — crop + re-point pipeline
